From cc2671a0e26bf989f8e4e8a294d99d4b03c525c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iPool bring-up <dev@ipool>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 15:41:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: add GM8775C MIPI-DSI to LVDS bridge (iPool
 SZ3568)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [out-of-tree ODM driver for the iPool SZ3568 (RK3568) GM8775C DSI->LVDS bridge; not for mainline]
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/Kconfig   |  11 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/Makefile  |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/gm8775c.c | 336 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 348 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/gm8775c.c

